1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,549
Two special routes.

2
00:00:01,549 --> 00:00:07,721
The coronary arteries feed the heart muscle itself; block them, and that is a heart attack.

3
00:00:07,721 --> 00:00:13,828
And the hepatic portal vein carries blood from the gut to the liver before it reaches the rest of the body.

